  "cited_article_id": "create-custom-appointment-types",
  "reply": "To configure a custom visit type, go to Settings > Scheduling > Appointment Types, click **New Type**, enter the name, set a duration between 5 and 480 minutes, choose a color, optionally check **Require Intake Form**, and click **Save**. If the new type does not show on the patient booking screen, verify that it is enabled for the appropriate facility under Settings > Scheduling > Locations, and confirm your user role has the **Manage Appointment Types** permission (Settings > Staff > Roles)."
}
